如果只想得到 Paris，最简单的方法是限制生成长度：
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:30000/generate \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "text": "The capital of France is",
    "sampling_params": {
      "temperature": 0,
      "max_new_tokens": 3
    }
  }'
或者把提示写成明确问答，并要求只回答城市：
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:30000/generate \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "text": "Question: What is the capital of France?\nAnswer with only the city name.\nAnswer:",
    "sampling_params": {
      "temperature": 0,
      "max_new_tokens": 8
    }
  }'
如果需要更稳定的指令遵循，使用 OpenAI Chat 接口更合适：
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:30000/v1/chat/completions \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "model": "deepseek-v4-flash-0731-w4a8",
    "messages": [
      {
        "role": "system",
        "content": "Answer concisely with only the requested city name."
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "What is the capital of France?"
      }
    ],
    "temperature": 0,
    "max_tokens": 8
  }'
